## In the blueprint

Every project follows the same seven layers, and fills only the ones its problem needs.

| Layer | Here |
| --- | --- |
| Sources | Not yet |
| Ingestion | dlt, one load per source, each run by `python -m pipelines load` |
| Storage | One DuckDB file on a laptop and in CI; Databricks in production |
| Modeling | dbt: staging and intermediate views, then a mart per domain with enforced contracts |
| Serving | The marts, and the dbt docs site with its lineage graph |
| Intelligence | Not yet |
| Product | Not yet |

